// ============================================================================
//  imgCareCallsBtn.Visible  -  WHO CAN SEE THE CUSTOMER CARE CALLS BUTTON.
//  Only users whose Teams 'S Coded?' value is exactly "Non S-Coded (Phil)".
//  Read from PowerBIIntegration.Data by the signed-in email (varUserEmail), so
//  'S Coded?' MUST be added to the Power BI visual's fields feeding the app.
// ============================================================================
LookUp(
    PowerBIIntegration.Data,
    Trim( Lower( 'User Email' & "" ) ) = Trim( varUserEmail )
).'S Coded?' = "Non S-Coded (Phil)"
